# Agent workflow

- Inspect existing patterns before adding new abstractions.
- Prefer small, reviewable diffs over broad rewrites.
- Flag ambiguous requirements instead of guessing on security or data handling.
- Run verification commands from `AGENTS.md` before claiming work is complete.
- At session end, offer a 3-bullet summary for **`CLAUDE.md`** if architecture or conventions changed.
